            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quivers"} quivers
            may have multiple arrows in the
            %em same
            direction (often called “parallel”), and also
            = succeed "," do
              %em loops
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/digraphs"} digraphs
            may not have any of those.
          %h2#overview_of_usual_technical_terms Overview of usual technical terms
          %blockquote
            %p
              We see one family, in the same room but hardly together. The family of signed, gain, and biased graphs is a lot like that. The Bibliography and Glossary are supposed to lead the family members to talk to one another. May they do so! (
              %a{:href => "#HomePageOfSignedGraphs"}> Thomas Zaslavsky: front page
              )
